[{"client_msg_id":"84d309c1-38fe-4afc-992b-3a57bcb7789c","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"History Graph はほしいな～。 \u003chttps://github.com/desktop/desktop/pull/9444\u003e","ts":"1635858616.364000","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"782x665px image","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/desktop/desktop/pull/9444|#9444 History Graph in comparison view\u003e","text":"Closes \u003chttps://github.com/desktop/desktop/issues/1634|#1634\u003e\n\n*Description*\n\nI implemented ''History Graph\" in comparison view.  \nYou should select comparison branch in history view. Then you can see the 'Graph' button.  \nThis is not a full graph according to \u003chttps://github.com/desktop/desktop/issues/1634|#1634\u003e, it will show you only 2 branch's graph.\n\n*Screenshots*\n\n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7362974/78351569-fd8a1d80-75e1-11ea-9c1f-1d70fee4e9cf.png|K-041\u003e  \n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7362974/78351574-ffec7780-75e1-11ea-9b60-eb16910d6c7f.png|K-040\u003e  \n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7362974/78351580-024ed180-75e2-11ea-8d4c-6a02575e90b1.png|K-037\u003e  \n\u003chttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7362974/78351584-04189500-75e2-11ea-8a5f-ee8a2bc107ee.png|K-036\u003e\n\n*Release notes*\n\nHistory Graph in comparison view.\n\nNotes:","image_url":"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7362974/78351569-fd8a1d80-75e1-11ea-9c1f-1d70fee4e9cf.png","fields":[{"title":"Comments","value":"1","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/desktop/desktop|desktop/desktop\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1585910518}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rxgZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"629a90da-2ed8-4673-915c-58c28cf5168b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こういうハックがいる。","ts":"1635858346.363400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4S3Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31ce51ac-308f-46bb-8be7-73e1927edc23","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/4651|https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/4651\u003e","ts":"1635858337.362900","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/4651|#4651 [FYI] Using git on msys2 \u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/4651|#4651 [FYI] Using git on msys2 \u003e","text":"As I filed issue ago, vscode can't work with msys2's git. Because git provided on msys2 return `/c/` prefixed-path for rev-parse command.\n\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode/issues/387|microsoft/vscode#387\u003e\n\nIf you really want to use msys2's git, try following.\n\n1. Write git-wrap.bat for git.exe\n    \n    ```\n    @echo off\n    setlocal\n    \n    rem If you don't add path for msys2 into %PATH%, enable following line.\n    rem set PATH=c:\\msys64\\usr\\bin;%PATH%\n    \n    if \"%1\" equ \"rev-parse\" goto rev_parse\n    git %*\n    goto :eof\n    :rev_parse\n    for /f %%1 in ('git %*') do cygpath -w %%1\n    ```\n    \n    Put this git-wrap.bat into somewhere.\n2. Set `git.path` for git-wrap.bat  \n    open `File` -\u0026gt; `Preferences` -\u0026gt; `User Settings`, And add `git.path` pointed `git-wrap.bat` on your configuration file like below.\n    \n    ```\n      \"git.path\": \"c:/users/mattn/bin/git-wrap.bat\",\n    \n    ```\n3. Restart vscode\n\nHave fun!","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"*question","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"2","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/vscode|microsoft/vscode\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1458836145}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wUCl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adbd0913-98ed-488d-a405-e8f91407362b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"vscode は Windows 版の git が出力するような /c/Users なパスに対応してないので問題が出るんですよね。","ts":"1635858326.362700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"08cU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12425e29-ec0d-4bf3-951b-31391f7c70b9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"bear token認証のサービスだとpushできるかもですね(gitlab,bitbucketとか?)\nまあ、アカウント管理というかトークン管理がどうなのか不明ですが","ts":"1635856860.360900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o0jJv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61858b57-1d32-4cd8-ba77-9668ecb7bf61","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"便利だ…","ts":"1635856761.360000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WlfSX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41242720-4bd3-4fce-964b-d095c44c1cf5","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"GitHub以外でもURLで指定はできますね。Pushがどうなるか試していませんが。","ts":"1635856747.359800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eQql"}]},{"client_msg_id":"12909a38-b5a1-4f13-bba7-70b8df65cebf","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"GitHub Desktop、画像の差分ビューワーとして便利ですよ","ts":"1635856740.359700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M6t+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74caacd3-92c8-4abb-b4ad-fbcb2cb2cb28","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"お、汎用？","ts":"1635856620.358200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V=7k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be8f15d8-3d7e-4f81-9b18-875e930e6eb3","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"とりあえずGitlabからのCloneはできました。","ts":"1635856590.357700","thread_ts":"1635848270.353700","subtype":"thread_broadcast","react